  Slug: minotaur
  DisplayName: Minotaur
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/alternatives/ancestries/minotaur.svg
  Description: Minotaurs stalk complex passageways, whether natural or artificial,
    and are masters of stone architecture. Inquisitive and steadfast, these bovine
    humanoids spend their lives perfecting the pursuit that calls to them, which
    can sometimes lead them far from the enclaves where they were raised. Minotaurs
    are originally from the Iblydos archipelago but have spread far and wide across
    Golarion, forming close-knit communities often near mountains or beneath the
    surface of the earth. Though sometimes mistaken for simple brutes, minotaurs
    have scholars and warriors alike. Those who can look past their appearance will
    find an affinity for building and navigation, as well as creative problem-solving.
    Minotaur
